node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
dist-frontend/
src-tauri/target/
# The generated iOS project is regenerated in full by `tauri ios init` and
# nothing in it is hand written -- persistent plist keys live in
# src-tauri/Info.ios.plist, which Tauri merges.
src-tauri/gen/*
!src-tauri/gen/android/

# gen/android/ is tracked. MainActivity.kt is the one file Tauri puts outside
# generated/, and it carries the window-inset handling that keeps the page out
# from under Android's system bars -- there is no configuration field for that,
# so the source is the only place it can live. Tauri ships .gitignore files
# inside the directory that exclude build output and jniLibs, so it costs about
# forty small files. `tauri android init` overwrites MainActivity.kt.
